  "lessons": [
    {
      "key": "lesson-1",
      "name": "What is Intelligence?",
      "absolute_position": 1,
      "lockable": false,
      "has_lesson_plan": true,
      "relative_position": 1,
      "properties": {
        "overview": "**What does it mean to be intelligent?**\n\nIn this lesson, students explore what intelligence means, examining the question from a human and machine perspective. They begin with their own intuitions and, through engaging with thought experiments and classroom discussions, they refine their thinking and emerge with a clearer understanding of their own definition of intelligence.",
        "preparation": "- Print copies of the Logic-Based AI Unit Guide (one for each student)\n- Print and cut out copies of the Intelligence Card Sort activity (one for each pair of two students)",
        "student_overview": "**What does it mean to be intelligent?**\n\nExplore what intelligence means, examining the question from a human and machine perspective."
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "lesson.key": "lesson-1",
        "lesson_group.key": "",
        "script.name": "aif-year2-semester1-unit1"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "lesson-2",
      "name": "AI’s Past, Present, and Future",
      "absolute_position": 2,
      "lockable": false,
      "has_lesson_plan": true,
      "relative_position": 2,
      "properties": {
        "overview": "**How did AI become what it is today?**\n\nIn this lesson, students explore the history of AI and some of the major milestones and innovations in the story of its development. They also consider ways in which AI is still developing and brainstorm what it might look like in the future. By the end of the lesson, students are able to place AI in historical context and recognize how individuals have contributed to its progress.",
        "preparation": "- Print copies of the AI Innovations handout (one for each student)",
        "student_overview": "**How did AI become what it is today?**\n\nExplore milestones in the history of AI and consider what AI might look like in the future."
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "lesson.key": "lesson-2",
        "lesson_group.key": "",
        "script.name": "aif-year2-semester1-unit1"
      }
    },
